# 1Password CLI environment for the AKS scripts.
#
# Usage:
#   1. Copy this file to .env:
#      cp .env.example .env
#   2. Update the op:// URIs to match your 1Password vault, item, and field names:
#      op://<vault>/<item>/<field>
#   3. Run the scripts that need these through `op run`:
#      VAULT_NAME=<key-vault> op run --env-file=.env -- ./aks-secrets-seed.sh
#
# The cluster itself never sees this file: aks-secrets-seed.sh copies the in-cluster secrets into
# Azure Key Vault, and External Secrets reads them from there.

# --- Copied to Key Vault by aks-secrets-seed.sh --------------------------------------------------
# (none yet - each entry here pairs with one in aks-secrets-seed.sh's SECRETS list)
